  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Watercolor Reunion by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Watercolor Reunion is beyond stunning! This multi-level home has it all, from its gorgeous outdoor pool courtyard to its game room, multiple living spaces, carriage house, and spacious, comfy bedrooms. Very nice.<br><br> Highlights:<br>📍 WaterColor!<br>👣 Close to beach access<br>👙 Private pool with fountains! (optional heat)<br>🥂 Outdoor oasis with dining area, fireplace, and gas grill<br>🛏️ 7 bedrooms, 6.5 bathrooms (includes carriage house)<br>👌🏼 Custom interiors with multiple living areas<br>🔥 Gas fireplace (available Dec–Feb)<br>😎 Multiple patios with swings, lounge chairs & hanging bed<br>🕹️ Third-floor game room with 3 TVs & 3 arcade units<br>🛺 6-seater golf cart<br>🚲 6 Bikes<br>🚿 Outdoor shower<br>🏡 Carriage house with kitchenette and primary bedroom<br> <br>The gorgeous courtyard is the star of the show! The three conjoined fountain pools are simply breathtaking, with benches for lounging, a grill and dining table for cookouts and group meals, and a fireplace for when the night winds down. This ultimate backyard oasis sets the stage for unforgettable memories.<br> <br>Inside, there’s a spot for everyone. Multiple primary suites, bunk rooms for the kids, and quiet corners to recharge. The chef’s kitchen features double dishwashers, a movable island, and pro appliances. The separate carriage house provides even more privacy, complete with its own sitting area and kitchenette.<br> <br>And since it’s an Oversee 30A home, you’re never on your own. Our local team is nearby every day of the week, quick to answer, and ready to step in if you need anything—even after hours.<br> <br>Overview:<br>- Prime WaterColor location<br>- 7 bedrooms, 6.5 bathrooms (includes carriage house)<br>- Main living area: Two couches, recliners, mounted TV, gas fireplace (Dec–Feb)<br>- Multiple patios<br>- Backyard courtyard with 3 fountain pools<br>- Private pool (can be seasonally heated for an additional $65.00 per day, contact Oversee for details)<br>- Gas fireplace available Dec–Feb<br>- Game room with 3 TVs + 3 arcade units<br>- Complimentary 6-seater street-legal golf cart<br>- 6 Bikes included<br>- Outdoor shower<br>- WiFi included<br>- Washer/dryer room with sink + counter space<br>- 4-car driveway (no street parking)<br>- Carriage house with primary suite, sitting area & kitchenette<br> <br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Guest Room: Queen bed, en suite closet & bathroom, walk-in shower, TV<br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Guest Room: Queen bed, en suite bathroom, shower/tub, TV, patio access with swing & chairs<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, en suite bathroom, double vanity, walk-in shower, soaking tub, <br> TV, private patio with hanging bed and sitting furniture overlooking pool<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, en suite bathroom, walk-in shower, TV<br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- Guest Bedroom: 4 queen beds, bathroom with shower/tub, no TV<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, TV<br>CARRIAGE HOUSE (Above owner’s private 2-car garage)<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, en suite bathroom, shower/tub combo<br> <br>Check-in: 4:00 PM CST Checkout: 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "WaterColor Reunions - 3 Private Heated Pools - Video Game Room!"
        }
      ],
